"entity": {
"name": "Dycom Industries, Inc.",
"description": "Dycom Industries, Inc. provides contracting services throughout the United States. The firm's services include engineering, construction, maintenance and installation services to telecommunications providers, underground facility locating services to various utilities, including other construction and maintenance services to electric and gas utilities, and others. It operates through the following segments: Communications and Building Systems. The Communications segment provides a range of construction, maintenance, and installation services, including the placement and splicing of fiber, copper, and coaxial cables. The Building Systems segment focuses on providing comprehensive building infrastructure solutions, including electrical, energy management, security, and fire safety systems for data centers and other critical facilities. The company was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in West Palm Beach, FL.",
